# org-target: docs/10-19-design/10-architecture/10.23-native-aitia-backpressure-content-review.org::#cross-intake-discovery-authority
# render-layout: elk; theme: 0; pad: 24; timeout: 30
direction: down
mandate: "Host-selected signed mandate\nTwo fixed intake owners + pinned public keys\nActive policy cannot delete known rejections"
intakes: {
  label: "Existing native ASCENT sources"
  a: "Intake A\n40 real observations / five counters\nFour native dispositions close locally"
  b: "Intake B\n28 real observations / six counters\nActual B64 M04 + M06 failures"
}
union: "Existing native registration + actual query\n46 observations / seven counters retained\nExact duplicate IDs only; no synthetic view\nSource-cut vector recorded in native trajectory"
technical: "Existing Aitia SWE-061/p1 gate\nSource + manifest + lock + six pointwise repairs\nA-only receipts cannot admit the complete union"
discovery: "Native SdlcHistoryDiscovery\nEvery required source: owner / snapshot / view\nExact source wire + native request snapshots\nSelecting A or B alone -> pending"
decisions: "Existing SdlcAuthorityAttestation\nReal signed target + policy + decision + record\nFrozen accepted bodies + sealed native requests\nAll accepted decisions stay in this review family"
negative: "Verified rejection persists\nNew policy / approved label / new reviewer cannot hide it\nExplicit authorized supersession names exact rejected ID"
reviewer: "Reviewer handoff\nInitial reviewer signs delegate key + exact target\nGrant binds exact supersession IDs\nWrong policy or signer label -> refused\nUnused positive approval does not create a blocker"
core: "Existing Core verification owner\nNative request snapshots + genuine receipts\nClone / expiry / revocation -> no admission\nExact signed-input closure checked before reuse"
gate: "Native authority gate\nTechnical blocker -> blocked\nIncomplete discovery or decision verification -> pending\nUnresolved signed rejection -> rejected\nComplete verified disposition -> bounded admission"
late: "New accepted denial or changed source cut\nOld frame cannot authorize current review\nPrescribed + presented input packets retained\nRust observations remain reusable historical evidence"
boundary: "Qualification boundary\nReal Rust runs + local test-only Ed25519 principals\n28 native-gate gold outcomes; same heap / watchdog\nNo human sign-off / global discovery / persistent recovery\nNo atomic external-use or performance claim"
mandate -> intakes
intakes.a -> union
intakes.b -> union
union -> technical -> discovery -> decisions
mandate -> discovery
mandate -> reviewer -> decisions
decisions -> negative -> core -> gate
gate -> late -> union: "recapture / reassess"
gate -> boundary
